11. Reconcile open broker positions against the local position ledger.
12. Detect and report broker/local discrepancies.
13. Run reconciliation after startup and periodically while orders or positions remain unresolved.
14. Ensure reconciliation errors never silently erase order history.

Do not create a live position from a `COMPLETE` label when the broker's authoritative filled quantity cannot be determined; fetch further details or mark it unresolved.

A broker fill discovered later must create/update the position even if the original HTTP request finished long ago.

